{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29421","headline":"无题四首 一 · 李商隐","name":"无题四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来是空言去绝踪，月斜楼上五更钟。\n梦爲远别啼难唤，书被催成墨未浓。\n蜡照半笼金翡翠，麝熏微度绣芙蓉。\n刘郎已恨蓬山远，更隔蓬山一万重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29421.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29421","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}